            "review_title": "Review at Ha Giang Bites",
            "review_text": "Bubbles585\nBristol, United Kingdom24 contributions\n0\nTasty little treat! Fresh food and shakes\nJan 2026 • Couples\nStumbled across this little he whilst wondering around Ha Giang looking for some food. Immediately drawn to their beautiful balcony and couldn’t resist. We were immediately invited in with a warm. Welcoming smile from their very friendly staff. Seated at a lovely seat over looking the river, looking at the mountain. The food was delicious and so, so fresh. Great menu, the staff couldn’t do enough for you and even went to buy fresh bananas after we ordered a banana milkshake. That was as amazing the food! Would 100% recommend to anyone looking for a bite to eat, definitely make this a stop! So tasty and so friendly! We will defo go back and absolutely recommend! The staff couldn’t do enough for you.\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2026",
